# An expression of the interpreted language of a point of program: a Scott
# sum of six constructors, in order: number (its value, a decimal text), add
# and multiply (their two operands), variable (its de Bruijn index, a
# decimal text), let (the bound expression and the body) and amb (its two
# operands, both values). Read by its position
# (com.yang_bo.gezi.contest.corpora.reductions.ReductionInterpreter, expressionOf,
# into Expression, whose cases are in this order).
λ export
. export
  (λvalue number add multiply variable let amb. number value)
  (λleft right number add multiply variable let amb. add left right)
  (λleft right number add multiply variable let amb. multiply left right)
  (λindex number add multiply variable let amb. variable index)
  (λbound body number add multiply variable let amb. let bound body) λleft right number add multiply variable let amb. amb left right
